    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A struggling content creator goes toe-to-toe with conspiracy and catastrophe in this short, narrative RPG. Adventure to the world of the Soda Kingdom, a plastic paradise that values the brand above all else!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753170/extras/ed9ea472173a4d6cb33503390aa1d4dc.avif?t=1752789516\" width=800 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast paced story-driven experience with many twists and turns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat!!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive soda drinking!!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753170/extras/ad680aeff82317a7fbab738580e89939.poster.avif?t=1752789516\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753170/extras/ad680aeff82317a7fbab738580e89939.webp?t=1752789516\" class=\"bb_img\" width=92 height=96 /></picture></span></p>",
